{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07645","headline":"汴河阻风 · 孟云卿","name":"汴河阻风","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清晨自梁宋，挂席之楚荆。\n出浦风渐恶，傍滩舟欲横。\n大河喷东注，羣动皆窅冥。\n白雾鱼龙气，黑云牛马形。\n苍茫迷所适，危安惧暂宁。\n信此天地内，孰爲身命轻。\n丈夫苟未达，所向须存诚。\n前路舍舟去，东南仍晓晴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟云卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07645.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07645","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}